  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Beautification &amp; Greening of schools in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mabati Technical Training Institute is planning to harvest and store rainwater during the upcoming rainy season in September to store over 1,500,000 litres of water. The dam measuring 1059 cubic metres if repaired with High-density polyethylene (HDPE), can last between 10 to 30 years &amp; supply enough water to irrigate our kitchen garden to produce  vegetables to support our school feeding program and to  educate our youth  on the importance of environmental conservation  and tree planting.</narrative>
  </description>
